the reference set (the best of G3 and G4 is taken over it): L/off, L/k64a2l1ns (the checkpoint policy G1 chose); M/crdb1 does not join: its median 99th-percentile commit at 7 days is not more than 10% below L/off's on either architecture (aarch64 Test ARM A: 2.01326592s against 10.48576ms; x86_64 Test X86 A: 3.221225472s against 15.72864ms), from run 100 at revision aaaaaaaaaaaa

